self.KB_CONTENT["card:780808"]={"id":"card:780808","ty":"card","sourceId":"780808","title":"『資料匯出入產生作業』中的『年度』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"合併","keywords":["合併","年度","出入"],"y":"other","answer":"* 此欄位不可空白。* 預設為合併財報參數設定作業(FCSI01)之「合併財報年度」。* 若「檔案代號」輸入為「FCSNA, FCSNG, FCSNL, FCSNM, FCSNN, FCSNO, FCSNP」，則此欄位不可輸入。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
